{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55636","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十四 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遁逸从来格自高，莫将泰山比秋毫。\n冷烟寒月真吾侣，瘦竹苍松是我曹。\n霜树叶疎幽径出，云泉声急晓风高。\n唯当话道闲吟外，时得功夫补毳袍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}